{"word":"κάλπη","uri":"kalpê","senses":[{"word":"κάλπη","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">κάλπη,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ης</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ἡ</span>)\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> trot (<span class=\"ital\">ou p.-ê.</span> galop, <span class=\"ital\">v.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">καλπάζω</span>) d’un cheval ; <span class=\"grec\">κάλπης δρόμος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Paus.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">5, 9, 1,</span> <span class=\"ital\">ou</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀγών,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">M.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">675</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, <span class=\"ital\">sorte de course aux jeux olympiques, où le cavalier, en\napprochant du but, devait prendre le trot, sauter à terre et suivre\nson cheval</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"ital\">c.</span> <span class=\"grec\">κάλπις,</span> vase,\n<span class=\"ital\">particul. :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> vase à puiser de l’eau,\n<span class=\"aut\">Aristén.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 4</span>\n||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> urne cinéraire,\n<span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Marc.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">30 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdn</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 15, 16 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 1,\n6</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> <span class=\"ital\">autre\nn. de la constellation</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὑδρεῖον,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Procl.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"etymrev\"><span class=\"etiqetymrev\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">pré-grec</span>.</div>\n"}]}